@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "WenQuanYi Micro Hei"
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false

state "对局进行中" as Playing
state "悔棋等待回应" as UndoPending
state "对局结束" as Ended

[*] --> Playing : createMatch\n随机黑方并启动棋钟
Playing --> Playing : 合法落子\n换手并 revision + 1
Playing --> UndoPending : 上一步玩家申请悔棋\n冻结棋钟
UndoPending --> Playing : 拒绝或 30 秒超时\n恢复对方棋钟
UndoPending --> Playing : 同意\n删除申请者最后一步并轮到申请者
Playing --> Ended : 五连 / 满盘和棋
Playing --> Ended : 认输 / 超时 / 主动退出
Playing --> Ended : 对方接受和棋
Ended --> [*] : 返回房间结算状态

note right of Playing
  和棋提议不改变主阶段，
  不暂停棋钟；对方落子
  会自动关闭未回应提议。
end note
@enduml
